WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.263
Welcome to Elevate for Humanity. I'm PARIS, your onboarding guide. Elevate expects

00:00:05.263 --> 00:00:10.526
premium education and professional service. Present yourself and your business professionally. Keep

00:00:10.526 --> 00:00:15.789
training spaces clean, safe and ready. Under your independent contractor agreement, you

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:21.051
operate your own business and deliver your assigned program services. Elevate provides

00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:26.314
the curriculum, platform, sponsor coordination, referrals and funding coordination stated in your

00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:31.577
agreement. Funding and student numbers are not guaranteed. Your signed agreement and

00:00:31.577 --> 00:00:36.840
applicable law control your responsibilities.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.040
Start with your own MOU in the dashboard. Check the organization, assigned

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.240
programs, duties and payment terms. Read the full agreement and any individual

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:49.440
addendum. Never use someone else's rates. If a field or original document

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:53.640
is missing, ask Elevate to correct it. Each person signs their own

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:57.840
agreement. Viewing a page or watching this video does not sign a

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.040
contract. Existing signatures remain on record; a new addendum needs its own

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:06.240
review.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:12.140
Read the handbook, confidentiality obligations, and the full non-compete and non-solicitation terms

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:18.040
linked in Forms. These describe how to protect student information and Elevate

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:23.940
relationships. Ask questions before accepting anything you do not understand. Communicate respectfully,

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:29.840
meet deadlines, and record actual attendance, progress and skills. Do not invent

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:35.740
hours or promise funding, credentials, jobs or payments. Site coordinators can download

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:41.640
team handouts, but each worker's own applicable agreement still controls their role.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:46.440
Open Complete and save my W-9. Enter the name shown on your

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:51.240
tax return. For a sole proprietor or disregarded LLC, line one generally

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:56.040
identifies the owner; the business name belongs on line two. Select the

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.840
federal tax classification from your tax records. Follow the official IRS instructions

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:05.640
if unsure. Enter your mailing address and the matching nine-digit taxpayer number.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:10.440
This is not a bank account number. Read the certification, indicate backup

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:15.240
withholding if applicable, then type your signature as the final entry. Save

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:20.040
the protected PDF and check your dashboard document register. Format checks do

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:24.840
not confirm an IRS name and number match.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:29.439
Open Payouts and select Fill out an invoice. Choose a student from

00:02:29.439 --> 00:02:34.038
your assigned dashboard roster. The form fills the student information, recorded training

00:02:34.038 --> 00:02:38.637
dates and the available agreed installment amount. Select training start or completion

00:02:38.637 --> 00:02:43.236
and review the source. An individual student schedule takes priority. Prior payments

00:02:43.236 --> 00:02:47.835
and holds may require review before another amount is suggested. You can

00:02:47.835 --> 00:02:52.434
edit the request, dates and description. Add your unique invoice reference and

00:02:52.434 --> 00:02:57.033
certify the facts. Submit for Elevate review. An invoice does not change

00:02:57.033 --> 00:03:01.632
your MOU and does not release a payment.

00:03:01.632 --> 00:03:06.189
Use the secure banking guide in Payouts. Request your personal QuickBooks contractor

00:03:06.189 --> 00:03:10.746
invitation if needed. Check your legal and tax information, then enter the

00:03:10.746 --> 00:03:15.303
account type, routing number and bank account number on the verified Intuit

00:03:15.303 --> 00:03:19.860
setup page. Use your bank's direct deposit instructions. A debit card number

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:24.417
is not a bank account number. Never send bank or taxpayer numbers

00:03:24.417 --> 00:03:28.974
in Office Mail. Complete the provider's verification and return to your dashboard

00:03:28.974 --> 00:03:33.531
to check status. PayPal is a separate available method where your agreement

00:03:33.531 --> 00:03:38.088
allows it. A saved destination is not proof of payment.

00:03:38.088 --> 00:03:43.320
Your Forms library contains the handbook, full agreements, W-9 flow, invoice form

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:48.552
and team templates. Fill Elevate-created forms in the dashboard. Existing identity documents,

00:03:48.552 --> 00:03:53.784
licenses and insurance still need original evidence from the issuer. Complete your

00:03:53.784 --> 00:03:59.016
program plan and required acknowledgements. Use Office Mail for help with a

00:03:59.016 --> 00:04:04.248
specific missing item. After this video ends, review any questions and sign

00:04:04.248 --> 00:04:09.480
the watched-and-understood acknowledgement. It records your statement and playback progress, not a

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:14.712
guarantee of understanding. Your MOU and other agreements still require their own

00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:19.944
signatures. Thank you for bringing excellence to your program.